  "description_text": "Tucked away on a gas-lit, tree-lined cul-de-sac in the Flat of Beacon Hill, 8 Charles River Square is a beautifully maintained townhome with two parking spaces, an entertainment sized roof deck with outstanding views, and access to the private Annie Fields Garden. This superb home features a sun-filled formal living room with room for a grand piano and an adjacent dry bar, a handsome library or home office, a formal dining room overlooking Annie Fields Garden, and an eat-in kitchen that opens to a fireside sitting area. The graciously proportioned primary suite features two walk-in closets and oversized windows overlooking the square. The garden level has its own separate entrance with a bedroom, bathroom, laundry room, and an additional bedroom that could serve a variety of functions. Additional features of this exceptional home include a sweeping central staircase, elegant fireplaces and custom built-ins for endless storage, all adding wonderful functionality and character. This tasteful and historic home is moments from the boutiques and fine dining of Charles Street, the Charles River Esplanade, Boston Common and the Public Garden.",
